The nvfp4-kv-diffkv, fix-mimo-v2-vllm, fix-modelopt-mixed-mxfp8 and
fix-prometheus-instrumentator-router mods under mods/, and the launch profile
(upstream-launch.sh, upstream-env.sh), are from
https://github.com/tonyd2wild/MiMo-V2.5-TP2-1M-NVFP4-KV-2xDGX-Spark at commit
6dae0a60dd3f90580029c2dd981a0cd5de49fc4e (MIT for the recipe files, see
LICENSE.upstream). The upstream licence file states that the mods are the work
of their respective upstream authors under their own licences; the patched
files are derived from vLLM (Apache-2.0). The drop-caches and
ray-keep-node-nccl-hca mods are host and orchestration helpers and are not
part of the image.
